{
  "name": "PR Review Reminder",
  "description": "Checks every 30 minutes for GitHub PRs assigned to itsmeeaizat that have no review for more than 2 hours, then sends a WhatsApp notification with PR links.",
  "trigger": {
    "condition": null,
    "config": {
      "trigger_type": "scheduled",
      "events": [],
      "schedule_mode": "recurring",
      "cron_expression": "*/30 * * * *",
      "one_time_date": null,
      "timezone": "Asia/Jakarta",
      "interval_value": null,
      "interval_unit": null,
      "interval_anchor": null,
      "ends_type": "never",
      "ends_on_date": null,
      "ends_after_count": null
    }
  },
  "definition": {
    "document": {
      "dsl": "1.0.0",
      "name": "pr_review_reminder",
      "version": "1.0",
      "namespace": "base44"
    },
    "do": [
      {
        "check_prs": {
          "call": "invoke_superagent_step",
          "with": {
            "message": "You are running an automated PR review reminder. Do the following:\n\n1. Use bash to call GitHub API to find open PRs assigned to 'itsmeeaizat' with no reviews:\n   curl -s -H 'Authorization: Bearer $GITHUB_ACCESS_TOKEN' 'https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=assignee:itsmeeaizat+type:pr+is:open+review:none'\n\n2. For each PR found, fetch its events to find when it was assigned:\n   curl -s -H 'Authorization: Bearer $GITHUB_ACCESS_TOKEN' 'https://api.github.com/repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues/{number}/events'\n   Look for the 'assigned' event and get its 'created_at' timestamp.\n\n3. Compare: if the assignment happened MORE than 2 hours ago from now, that PR needs a reminder.\n\n4. If there are PRs needing reminders, compose a concise WhatsApp message in Indonesian like:\n   '\ud83d\udd14 PR belum di-review (>2 jam):\n   - [PR title] \u2014 {repo}\n   Link: {html_url}\n   ...\n   Tolong review ya!'\n   Send it to me via WhatsApp.\n\n5. If no PRs need attention (none assigned >2 hours without review, or no PRs at all), do nothing and end silently.\n\nOnly send a message when there are actual PRs to flag. Do not send 'no PRs found' messages."
          },
          "then": "end",
          "x-base44": {
            "title": "Cek PR GitHub",
            "description": "Cari PR yang belum di-review >2 jam, kirim WhatsApp"
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}